            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary">
              Form a District Working Group Within 60 Days
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-text-primary font-medium mb-4">
            Convene parents, teachers, and administrators to translate these goals into formal HVRSD district policy.
          </p>
          <div class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed border-t border-[#E5D6C7]/60 pt-4">
            <p>
              A structured, collaborative pathway ensures timely progress, practical support for teachers, and sustained community dialogue.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <!-- Accommodations Notice -->
